{"seq":3,"slug":"abstraction-encapsulation","title":"抽象与封装模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/abstraction-encapsulation","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽象与封装模式\">抽象与封装模式</h1><p>OCaml 的模块系统不仅是代码组织工具——它是一套精密的信息隐藏机制。通过签名约束、抽象类型和私有类型，模块可以精确控制哪些实现细节对外暴露、哪些被永久隐藏。这种能力是构建可演进、可维护的大型系统的基石：接口稳定时，实现可以自由更换而不破坏任何依赖方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抽象与封装由签名约束与类型可见性共同实现，其手段可以归为三种透明度级别。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽象类型</td>\n<td>签名只写 <code>type t</code>，不给定义</td>\n<td>外部无法构造或解构，只能经模块操作访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有类型</td>\n<td><code>type t = private ...</code> 只读透明</td>\n<td>可读取/模式匹配/向上强制转换，但不能直接构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全透明</td>\n<td>签名给出类型的完整定义</td>\n<td>数据结构的形状成为稳定 API 的一部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名裁剪</td>\n<td>同一模块经不同签名暴露不同接口层</td>\n<td>公共、内部、测试三条可见性边界可共存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：封装的本质是选择把「表示」隐藏到哪一层——隐藏得越深，实现越自由，但外部能做的操作也越少。下面依次展开抽象类型、私有类型、签名裁剪、Phantom Module 模式、mixin 组合与密封策略的工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽象类型-隐藏表示\">抽象类型：隐藏表示</h2><p>抽象类型是模块系统最核心的封装机制。签名中声明 <code>type t</code> 但不给出定义，外部代码就无法直接构造或解构该类型的值——只能通过模块提供的操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type MONEY = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val zero : t&#10;  val of_cents : int -&gt; t&#10;  val add : t -&gt; t -&gt; t&#10;  val to_string : t -&gt; string&#10;  (* 没有暴露内部表示，无法直接做算术 *)&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Money : MONEY = struct&#10;  type t = int  (* 内部用分存储 *)&#10;  let zero = 0&#10;  let of_cents n = n&#10;  let add = ( + )&#10;  let to_string cents =&#10;    Printf.sprintf &quot;$%d.%02d&quot; (cents / 100) (abs (cents mod 100))&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 外部代码 *)&#10;let total = Money.(add (of_cents 1099) (of_cents 599))&#10;(* let bad = Money.add total 100 -- 编译错误：int ≠ Money.t *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type MONEY = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val zero : t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val of_cents : int -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val add : t -> t -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_string : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* 没有暴露内部表示，无法直接做算术 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Money : MONEY = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = int  (* 内部用分存储 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let zero = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let of_cents n = n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let add = ( + )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let to_string cents =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Printf.sprintf \"$%d.%02d\" (cents / 100) (abs (cents mod 100))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 外部代码 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let total = Money.(add (of_cents 1099) (of_cents 599))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* let bad = Money.add total 100 -- 编译错误：int ≠ Money.t *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>抽象类型的工程价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不变量保护</td>\n<td>无法构造违反约束的值（如负金额）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现自由</td>\n<td>可以从 <code>int</code> 换成 <code>{dollars:int; cents:int}</code> 而不破坏 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型区分</td>\n<td><code>Money.t</code> 和 <code>int</code> 是不同类型，防止混用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化空间</td>\n<td>内部表示可随时优化（如换成定点数）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"私有类型-只读透明\">私有类型：只读透明</h2><p>有时完全隐藏表示过于严格——你想让外部代码能模式匹配或读取内部结构，但不能直接构造。私有类型（private type）正是这个中间地带：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type VALIDATED_EMAIL = sig&#10;  type t = private string&#10;  val create : string -&gt; (t, string) result&#10;  val to_string : t -&gt; string&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Email : VALIDATED_EMAIL = struct&#10;  type t = string&#10;  let create s =&#10;    if String.contains s &#39;@&#39; then Ok s&#10;    else Error &quot;invalid email: missing @&quot;&#10;  let to_string = Fun.id&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 外部代码 *)&#10;let valid = Email.create &quot;user@example.com&quot;&#10;(* let hack : Email.t = &quot;not-validated&quot; -- 编译错误 *)&#10;(* 但可以: *)&#10;let print e = Printf.printf &quot;Email: %s\\n&quot; (e : Email.t :&gt; string)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type VALIDATED_EMAIL = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = private string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val create : string -> (t, string) result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_string : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Email : VALIDATED_EMAIL = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let create s =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if String.contains s '@' then Ok s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else Error \"invalid email: missing @\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let to_string = Fun.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 外部代码 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let valid = Email.create \"user@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* let hack : Email.t = \"not-validated\" -- 编译错误 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 但可以: *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let print e = Printf.printf \"Email: %s\\n\" (e : Email.t :> string)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三种透明度级别的对比：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[类型透明度] --&gt; B[完全抽象 type t]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;私有类型 type t = private ...&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;完全透明 type t = ...&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[不能构造]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[不能解构]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[不能强制转换]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[不能构造]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[可以解构/匹配]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;可以向上强制转换 :&gt;&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[可以构造]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[可以解构]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[完全透明]\">graph TD\n    A[类型透明度] --&gt; B[完全抽象 type t]\n    A --&gt; C[\"私有类型 type t = private ...\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"完全透明 type t = ...\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[不能构造]\n    B --&gt; B2[不能解构]\n    B --&gt; B3[不能强制转换]\n    C --&gt; C1[不能构造]\n    C --&gt; C2[可以解构/匹配]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"可以向上强制转换 :&gt;\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[可以构造]\n    D --&gt; D2[可以解构]\n    D --&gt; D3[完全透明]</pre><h2 id=\"签名裁剪-渐进式暴露\">签名裁剪：渐进式暴露</h2><p>同一个模块可以通过不同的签名对不同的使用方暴露不同的接口层次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type CACHE_PUBLIC = sig&#10;  type &#39;a t&#10;  val create : capacity:int -&gt; &#39;a t&#10;  val get : &#39;a t -&gt; string -&gt; &#39;a option&#10;  val set : &#39;a t -&gt; string -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; unit&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type CACHE_INTERNAL = sig&#10;  include CACHE_PUBLIC&#10;  val stats : &#39;a t -&gt; { hits : int; misses : int; evictions : int }&#10;  val clear : &#39;a t -&gt; unit&#10;  val resize : &#39;a t -&gt; int -&gt; unit&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type CACHE_TESTING = sig&#10;  include CACHE_INTERNAL&#10;  type &#39;a entry = { value : &#39;a; inserted_at : float; access_count : int }&#10;  val inspect : &#39;a t -&gt; (string * &#39;a entry) list&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Cache : CACHE_TESTING = struct&#10;  (* 完整实现 *)&#10;  type &#39;a entry = { value : &#39;a; inserted_at : float; access_count : int }&#10;  type &#39;a t = {&#10;    mutable data : (string, &#39;a entry) Hashtbl.t;&#10;    capacity : int;&#10;    mutable hits : int;&#10;    mutable misses : int;&#10;    mutable evictions : int;&#10;  }&#10;  (* ... 实现省略 ... *)&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 对外暴露窄接口 *)&#10;module Public_cache : CACHE_PUBLIC = Cache&#10;(* 内部使用宽接口 *)&#10;module Internal_cache : CACHE_INTERNAL = Cache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type CACHE_PUBLIC = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val create : capacity:int -> 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val get : 'a t -> string -> 'a option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val set : 'a t -> string -> 'a -> unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type CACHE_INTERNAL = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include CACHE_PUBLIC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val stats : 'a t -> { hits : int; misses : int; evictions : int }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val clear : 'a t -> unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val resize : 'a t -> int -> unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type CACHE_TESTING = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include CACHE_INTERNAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a entry = { value : 'a; inserted_at : float; access_count : int }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val inspect : 'a t -> (string * 'a entry) list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Cache : CACHE_TESTING = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* 完整实现 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a entry = { value : 'a; inserted_at : float; access_count : int }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a t = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mutable data : (string, 'a entry) Hashtbl.t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    capacity : int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mutable hits : int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mutable misses : int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mutable evictions : int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* ... 实现省略 ... *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 对外暴露窄接口 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Public_cache : CACHE_PUBLIC = Cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 内部使用宽接口 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Internal_cache : CACHE_INTERNAL = Cache</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"phantom-module-pattern\">Phantom Module Pattern</h2><p>将幻影类型与模块抽象结合，创建不可伪造的类型级标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type PERMISSION = sig&#10;  type t&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Read_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end&#10;module Write_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end&#10;module Admin_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end&#10;&#10;type &#39;perm token = { user_id : int; _perm : &#39;perm }&#10;&#10;module Auth : sig&#10;  val login : user:string -&gt; password:string -&gt; Read_perm.t token option&#10;  val escalate : Read_perm.t token -&gt; Write_perm.t token option&#10;  val read_data : Read_perm.t token -&gt; string&#10;  val write_data : Write_perm.t token -&gt; string -&gt; unit&#10;end = struct&#10;  let login ~user ~password =&#10;    if verify user password then&#10;      Some { user_id = lookup_id user; _perm = Obj.magic () }&#10;    else None&#10;&#10;  let escalate token =&#10;    if has_write_access token.user_id then&#10;      Some { user_id = token.user_id; _perm = Obj.magic () }&#10;    else None&#10;&#10;  let read_data _token = &quot;data&quot;&#10;  let write_data _token _data = ()&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type PERMISSION = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Read_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Write_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Admin_perm : PERMISSION = struct type t end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type 'perm token = { user_id : int; _perm : 'perm }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Auth : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val login : user:string -> password:string -> Read_perm.t token option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val escalate : Read_perm.t token -> Write_perm.t token option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val read_data : Read_perm.t token -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val write_data : Write_perm.t token -> string -> unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let login ~user ~password =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if verify user password then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Some { user_id = lookup_id user; _perm = Obj.magic () }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let escalate token =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if has_write_access token.user_id then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Some { user_id = token.user_id; _perm = Obj.magic () }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let read_data _token = \"data\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let write_data _token _data = ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>因为 <code>Read_perm.t</code>、<code>Write_perm.t</code>、<code>Admin_perm.t</code> 是不同的抽象类型，外部代码无法伪造权限升级——必须通过 <code>Auth.escalate</code> 函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixin-模式-通过-include-组合能力\">Mixin 模式：通过 include 组合能力</h2><p>OCaml 不使用类继承来复用代码——而是通过 <code>include</code> + functor 的组合实现 mixin 式的能力叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type SHOWABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val show : t -&gt; string&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type COMPARABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val compare : t -&gt; t -&gt; int&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type HASHABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val hash : t -&gt; int&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Add_show (S : SHOWABLE) = struct&#10;  include S&#10;  let print x = print_endline (show x)&#10;  let debug x = Printf.printf &quot;[DEBUG] %s\\n&quot; (show x)&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Add_order (C : COMPARABLE) = struct&#10;  include C&#10;  let ( &lt; ) a b = compare a b &lt; 0&#10;  let ( &gt; ) a b = compare a b &gt; 0&#10;  let min a b = if compare a b &lt;= 0 then a else b&#10;  let max a b = if compare a b &gt;= 0 then a else b&#10;  let clamp ~lo ~hi x = min hi (max lo x)&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Int_full = struct&#10;  type t = int&#10;  let show = string_of_int&#10;  let compare = Int.compare&#10;  let hash = Hashtbl.hash&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Int_with_show = Add_show(Int_full)&#10;module Int_with_order = Add_order(Int_full)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type SHOWABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val show : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type COMPARABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val compare : t -> t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type HASHABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val hash : t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Add_show (S : SHOWABLE) = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include S</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let print x = print_endline (show x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let debug x = Printf.printf \"[DEBUG] %s\\n\" (show x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Add_order (C : COMPARABLE) = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let ( &#x3C; ) a b = compare a b &#x3C; 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let ( > ) a b = compare a b > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let min a b = if compare a b &#x3C;= 0 then a else b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let max a b = if compare a b >= 0 then a else b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let clamp ~lo ~hi x = min hi (max lo x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Int_full = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let show = string_of_int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let compare = Int.compare</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let hash = Hashtbl.hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Int_with_show = Add_show(Int_full)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Int_with_order = Add_order(Int_full)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函子 mixin</td>\n<td><code>include</code> + functor 应用</td>\n<td>静态分派、类型安全、零开销</td>\n<td>语法较重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一等模块策略</td>\n<td>运行时选择模块</td>\n<td>动态灵活</td>\n<td>间接调用开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象系统</td>\n<td>类+继承</td>\n<td>结构子类型</td>\n<td>罕用、性能较差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPX 派生</td>\n<td>编译期代码生成</td>\n<td>极简语法</td>\n<td>魔法感、调试困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"密封策略的工程实践\">密封策略的工程实践</h2><p>在真实项目中，选择正确的密封策略直接影响 API 的可演进性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 策略 1: 强抽象 — 类型完全不透明 *)&#10;module Uuid : sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val create : unit -&gt; t&#10;  val to_string : t -&gt; string&#10;  val of_string : string -&gt; t option&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 策略 2: 结构透明 — 允许模式匹配 *)&#10;module Ast : sig&#10;  type expr =&#10;    | Literal of int&#10;    | Binary of { op : op; left : expr; right : expr }&#10;    | Variable of string&#10;  and op = Add | Sub | Mul | Div&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 策略 3: 部分抽象 — with type 暴露关键类型等式 *)&#10;module String_map : Map.S with type key = String.t\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 策略 1: 强抽象 — 类型完全不透明 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Uuid : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val create : unit -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_string : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val of_string : string -> t option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 策略 2: 结构透明 — 允许模式匹配 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Ast : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type expr =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Literal of int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Binary of { op : op; left : expr; right : expr }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Variable of string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  and op = Add | Sub | Mul | Div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 策略 3: 部分抽象 — with type 暴露关键类型等式 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module String_map : Map.S with type key = String.t</span></span></code></pre></div><p>经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>值语义的封装类型（ID、金额、令牌）→ 强抽象</li>\n<li>需要外部模式匹配的数据（AST、协议消息）→ 结构透明</li>\n<li>容器/集合类型 → 暴露 key/element 类型等式，隐藏内部结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>封装的本质是选择透明度的层次</strong>：完全抽象、私有类型、完全透明三种级别分别对应「不能构造也不能解构」「只读透明」「形状即 API」。</li>\n<li><strong>抽象类型保护不变量</strong>：<code>Money.t</code> 无法用裸 <code>int</code> 参与算术，实现可在 <code>int</code> 与记录之间自由更换而不破坏调用方。</li>\n<li><strong>私有类型是中间地带</strong>：可以读取、模式匹配、向上强制转换，但构造必须经过校验函数——适合 Email、Uuid 这类需要验证的值。</li>\n<li><strong>签名裁剪实现渐进式暴露</strong>：同一模块经公共、内部、测试三条签名暴露不同接口层，可见性边界因此显式可控。</li>\n<li><strong>幻影类型与模块抽象结合可制造不可伪造的标记</strong>：<code>Read_perm.t</code>/<code>Write_perm.t</code> 是不同抽象类型，外部无法绕过 <code>Auth.escalate</code> 伪造权限升级。</li>\n<li><strong>复用靠 mixin 而非继承</strong>：<code>include</code> + functor 的静态组合与一等模块的动态策略、对象系统、PPX 派生各有取舍，需按场景选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经验法则是：值语义的封装类型用强抽象，需要外部模式匹配的数据用结构透明，容器/集合则暴露 key 与元素类型等式而隐藏内部结构。掌握在什么层次使用什么程度的抽象，是 OCaml 系统编程中最需要判断力的技能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽象与封装模式","id":"抽象与封装模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抽象类型：隐藏表示","id":"抽象类型-隐藏表示"},{"level":2,"text":"私有类型：只读透明","id":"私有类型-只读透明"},{"level":2,"text":"签名裁剪：渐进式暴露","id":"签名裁剪-渐进式暴露"},{"level":2,"text":"Phantom Module Pattern","id":"phantom-module-pattern"},{"level":2,"text":"Mixin 模式：通过 include 组合能力","id":"mixin-模式-通过-include-组合能力"},{"level":2,"text":"密封策略的工程实践","id":"密封策略的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一等公民模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/first-class-modules"},"next":{"title":"多核域与纤程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/multicore-domains-fibers"}}